alue) {\n \t\tString new_request;\n \n \t\tfor (const String &E : rheaders) {\n-\t\t\tif (E.containsn(\"Location: \")) {\n+\t\t\tif (E.starts_withn(\"Location: \")) {","path":"scene/main/http_request.cpp","commit_id":"9bc59cd1006552f45d906a7834c1b454c4d76b4e","original_commit_id":"dc0d34edbbfb5caa946d924bf1068e5cf035e911","user":{"login":"BadMachine","id":50546204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNTQ2MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50546204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BadMachine","html_url":"https://github.com/BadMachine","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BadMachine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BadMachine/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BadMachine/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BadMachine/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BadMachine/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BadMachine/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BadMachine/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BadMachine/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BadMachine/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Thank you.\r\nI was looking for the method :)","created_at":"2025-07-07T21:14:42Z","updated_at":"2025-07-07T21:14:42Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108387#discussion_r2191022179","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108387","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2191022179"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108387#discussion_r2191022179"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108387"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2191022179/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":243,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2190965223,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":5,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2206075270","pull_request_review_id":3018206049,"id":2206075270,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6DfgmG","diff_hunk":"@@ -240,7 +240,7 @@ bool HTTPRequest::_handle_response(bool *ret_value) {\n \t\tString new_request;\n \n \t\tfor (const String &E : rheaders) {\n-\t\t\tif (E.containsn(\"Location: \")) {\n+\t\t\tif (E.to_lower().begins_with(\"location: \")) {\n \t\t\t\tnew_request = E.substr(9).strip_edges();\n \t\t\t}","path":"scene/main/http_request.cpp","commit_id":"9bc59cd1006552f45d906a7834c1b454c4d76b4e","original_commit_id":"9bc59cd1006552f45d906a7834c1b454c4d76b4e","user":{"login":"mhilbrunner","id":1654763,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTQ3NjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1654763?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner","html_url":"https://github.com/mhilbrunner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"```suggestion\r\n\t\t\tif (E.to_lower().begins_with(\"location: \")) {\r\n\t\t\t\tnew_request = E.substr(9).strip_edges();\r\n\t\t\t\tbreak;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n```\r\nWe can stop parsing headers if we found the first `Location` header, as the HTTP spec only allows one of each header.\r\n\r\nAlso, further down in line 253, we check `if (new_request.begins_with(\"http\"))` to determine whether the URL is relative or absolute to determine whether this should be a new request? I haven't looked at this more than reviewing this PR and its quite late here, so I might be missing things, but if true, there are two suspect things here for me:\r\n\r\n1. `http` alone is strictly speaking not enough to determine if the following URL is absolute. We may want to check whether the request begins with `http://` or `https://`. I'm also not sure what the conditions are for which we require a new request. Maybe we should instead check that this is still the same FQDN?\r\n2. At first glance, this check seems to be case sensitive, which is against [spec](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc3986#section-3.1): `An implementation\r\n   should accept uppercase letters as equivalent to lowercase in scheme\r\n   names (e.g., allow \"HTTP\" as well as \"http\") for the sake of\r\n   robustness but should only produce lowercase scheme names for\r\n   consistency.`\r\n\r\nThis may not be worth blocking this PR on however, as this fix should probably get in sooner than later, and the above is a bit more involved and should probably be a followup for 4.6.","created_at":"2025-07-15T01:03:11Z","updated_at":"2025-07-15T01:16:29Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108387#discussion_r2206075270","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108387","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2206075270"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108387#discussion_r2206075270"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108387"}},"reactions":{"url":"https: